1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:03,997
Today I decided to make a Spider-Man game using only

2
00:00:03,997 --> 00:00:05,222
artificial intelligence.

3
00:00:05,222 --> 00:00:08,769
I started with an empty Roblox city and asked for

4
00:00:08,769 --> 00:00:10,669
a giant spider-web checkpoint.

5
00:00:10,669 --> 00:00:13,245
Then came the important part: swinging.

6
00:00:13,245 --> 00:00:16,454
My first prompt created a web that attached to

7
00:00:16,454 --> 00:00:19,663
buildings, but the movement looked like a shopping bag

8
00:00:19,663 --> 00:00:21,225
in a hurricane.

9
00:00:21,225 --> 00:00:24,772
I asked the AI to fix the direction, the speed,

10
00:00:24,772 --> 00:00:26,335
and the camera.

11
00:00:26,335 --> 00:00:29,882
One web was not enough, so I added a second

12
00:00:29,882 --> 00:00:31,022
one.

13
00:00:31,022 --> 00:00:34,569
Suddenly the hero could swing with both hands, and it

14
00:00:34,569 --> 00:00:36,131
looked surprisingly cool.

15
00:00:36,131 --> 00:00:39,678
Of course, it also threw him into walls, rooftops, and

16
00:00:39,678 --> 00:00:40,903
empty space.

17
00:00:40,903 --> 00:00:44,492
Next I added animations, momentum, and a new rule.

18
00:00:44,492 --> 00:00:48,039
When I pressed the space bar while swinging, the web

19
00:00:48,039 --> 00:00:49,939
launched the player forward.

20
00:00:49,939 --> 00:00:52,810
That made traveling faster and every crash much

21
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:53,950
funnier.

22
00:00:53,950 --> 00:00:56,822
After several prompts, the webs could attach to

23
00:00:56,822 --> 00:00:59,693
different buildings, release at the right time, and

24
00:00:59,693 --> 00:01:02,607
carry the character across the entire city.

25
00:01:02,607 --> 00:01:04,845
Sometimes the AI understood perfectly.

26
00:01:04,845 --> 00:01:08,392
Other times I had to explain: please do not send

27
00:01:08,392 --> 00:01:10,630
my player to the moon.

28
00:01:10,630 --> 00:01:13,839
By the end, the basic Spider-Man movement was finally

29
00:01:13,839 --> 00:01:14,979
playable.

30
00:01:14,979 --> 00:01:18,568
It was not perfect, but it was definitely chaotic.

31
00:01:18,568 --> 00:01:22,115
Would you use AI prompts to build a game? Tell

32
00:01:22,115 --> 00:01:25,367
me, and watch part two for the superpowers!
